[Music]  snack food is often deemed as unhealthy  but  it doesn't have to be registered  dietitian mia sin  shares tips on how to snack smarter  without breaking your diet plus  some delicious recipes that you can make  at home  hey las vegas now i hope you like  snacking because today i have some  delicious healthier options  plus some tips on how to snack smarter  so my first tip  is to focus on protein and fiber which  will help you feel full  longer american pecans are the original  super nut that can elevate the nutrition  of your snacks without sacrificing  cravable taste  and satisfying crunch each one ounce  serving of pecans provides three grams  of protein and fiber  along with essential minerals including  zinc and 12 grams of good  monounsaturated fats they're among the  lowest in carbs and highest in fiber  compared to other nuts  whether you want something sweet savory  crunchy or creamy  pecans are incredibly versatile and can  enhance any snack break  use them to make these savory spiced  pecan energy bites  for the batter blend together a half cup  of pecan pieces one cup of oats two  tablespoons of tahini one tablespoon of  honey a half tablespoon of mustard and  your savory spices  find these recipes and more delicious  and nutritious ways to clean up your  snacks with pecans  at americanpecan.com snacks  now bars are another way to check your  protein and fiber boxes  iq bars are protein bars formulated with  ingredients and nutrients  shown to benefit the brain including  lion's mane and mct  they have 12 grams of plant protein and  are vegan keto friendly and free of  gluten and dairy  find them at smith's sprouts cvs and eat  iqbar.com  next find nutritious ways to satisfy  your sweet cravings  try apple cookies slice your apples into  fourth inch thick rounds  i'm using the cosmic crisp apples which  are grown in washington state and prized  for their perfectly balanced flavor and  delightfully crisp  texture they're a cross between  enterprise and honey crisp apples  they're great for baking  and snacking another better way to  satisfy your sweet cravings is with  fruit popsicles  popsicle fruit twisters are a fun better  for your treat with 70 calories per pop  made with real fruit  milk and no artificial flavors they come  in delicious varieties including  strawberry blueberry and vanilla swirl  and the new mango strawberry and vanilla  swirl finally find nutritious ways to  satisfy your crunchy craving  these bite-sized organic rice cake minis  by lundberg family farms  fit the bill they're made with organic  whole grain brown rice and come in sweet  and savory flavors including white  cheddar  sea salt apple pie and buffalo ranch my  favorite is the ginger seaweed which are  tossed in a savory umami seasoning with  a kick of heat and a dab of sweet for a  super unique flavor  i recommend pairing this crunchy whole  grain snack with nutritious dips like  guacamole salsa or hummus  to build a satisfying snack now we hope  you enjoyed all of these tips and  recipes you can find them at my website  nutritionbymia.com  and nutritionbynia on instagram where i  also share meal ideas and nutrition tips  daily thank you mia las vegas now will  be

